Webino Shield native ruleset
============================

- Native WordPress / WooCommerce probe rules are original to Webino.
- OWASP CRS-inspired patterns (SQLi/XSS heuristics) are independently authored
  for Shield and are not a verbatim copy of OWASP CRS or Wordfence signatures.
- Community YARA / PHP Malware Finder subsets, when vendored later, keep their
  upstream SPDX / license files alongside the rule files.
